WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.376
♪♪

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.961
Narrator:
Welcome to Mega City.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.379
Wh-ha-ha-hoo.!

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:06.798
Narrator:
Where everyday is an adventure.

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:07.799
Wow.

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:09.343
But I've never heard of that
word.

00:00:09.343 --> 00:00:12.930
(Grasps)
You've never heard of an
adventure?

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.014
Narrator:
Oh, hi Doug.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.641
Narrator:
Everyone, wave hi to Doug.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:16.808
Hello.
Lady:
-Sorry, Doug.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:20.687
Narrator:
I forgot, as a robot you're 
not as familiar with life in Mega City.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:21.980
Narrator:
I think we can help you.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.148
Great idea.

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.192
Narrator:
Everybody, should we help Doug?

00:00:25.192 --> 00:00:26.818
Yes!
Narrator:
Okay.

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.362
Narrator:
So, Doug...

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:30.989
Narrator:
An adventure is sort of a fun
journey you take.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.616
Narrator:
Like walking through your town.

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:34.034
Narrator:
Or maybe going hiking.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.369
Hiking?
-Never heard of it.

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:38.372
Narrator:
Well, Doug, why don't you unplug
and try it out.

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:40.874
Does this mean we're going on a
hike today?

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.626
I think it's time for some

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:47.047
good old-fashioned, 
robot-father, robot-son,
robot-bonding.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.424
(Haha)
-Oh...
-hehe.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.260
Narrator:
And that's just one example.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.263
Narrator:
Say, you and your friend, Emma,
wanted to go to the beach.

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:55.931
Beach? I don't know that word.

00:00:55.931 --> 00:00:57.641
Narrator:
You'll love the beach.

00:00:57.641 --> 00:00:59.559
Narrator:
There's so much to do and
discover.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.436
Let's go mateys.

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:03.021
(Digging)

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:04.773
Ahh.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:05.774
Ahh.

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:07.025
♪♪

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:09.027
oooh.
♪♪

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:11.738
Narrator:
Wow. You found some great
treasures.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.365
Narrator:
They could belong in a museum.

00:01:13.365 --> 00:01:16.868
Oh.
Aah... What's a museum?

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.912
Narrator:
There's only one way to find
out.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.790
No trip to the museum is
complete without exploring

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.917
an early machines exhibit.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:24.918
Whoa.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:29.047
All you have to do is pull on
this rope and you'll lift
something really  heavy.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:32.759
Now I'm lifting me, Emma, Uncle
ForkRick, and...

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.760
Who are you?

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.012
I'm Gary.

00:01:35.012 --> 00:01:36.430
And Gary!

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:38.849
Narrator:
When you're all done, you can
ride your bike home.

00:01:38.849 --> 00:01:42.728
I have a big question.
Why do humans ride bikes?

00:01:42.728 --> 00:01:46.023
To get that thrill when rubber
meets the road.

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:47.107
When rubber meets the...

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:50.736
You know what, you'll just have
to learn to ride a bike and see
for yourself.

00:01:50.736 --> 00:01:52.070
Narrator:
Great idea, Emma. 

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.281
Narrator:
Now get out there and explore.
-Whohoo.

00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:56.366
Narrator:
Because the more questions 
you ask,

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:58.201
Narrator:
the more adventures you'll discover.

00:01:58.201 --> 00:02:01.079
Doug:
I can tell you're excited about
this adventure idea.

00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:03.498
Adventures look amazing.

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:06.460
Unplug and follow me.
-Woo-hoo.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.003
Woo-hoo.
Narrator:
Doug Unplugs

00:02:08.003 --> 00:02:11.548
I learned how to have fun!
-Let's somersault...

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.216
Enjoy!

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:15.302
♪♪

